{"v":4,"catch":"解決超過100道棘手的螺絲謎題，並將它們全部拆解！","desc":"從簡單到困難，挑戰超過100種不同難度的螺絲解謎關卡。鬆開各種形狀的零件——從環狀物到複雜結構，逐一卸下螺絲以露出梁柱。注意：順序至關重要！但別擔心，遇到瓶頸時多種助推道具將助你一臂之力！拿起你的螺絲起子，立刻開始吧！重玩已通關的關卡即可獲得金幣。","publisher":"Kistler Studios","release":"2025-12-25","genres":["益智","桌上遊戲","學習","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6cc344a4d4ba8642d17b1b20bdf77d0ccc4efd9678485b19b86d5f81eb93bde6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3d5a1b2423b09ae5d88b7934580ca5eb11ac1e770e9e4c809824196bb836f994.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6e99b3c9dba2b71874da6dde800c4bce328bf7c8244c9f5bbea1f7e6b498cd11.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/89d0de1956983cd7bba73a1aab3448dd2a2611db0a99bbdb2f0ac4c551349a17.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a79cada765331bf8767c2fd6537212798551a2d201c88f2a232acb335c4347ac.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c6201bbb2000","dlc":[]}